{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:01SB:statement", "parent_tag": "01S5", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an affine morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002>.\nThe functor <MATH_0003> induces\nan equivalence of categories\n<MATHSEG_0001>category of quasi-coherent<MATHSEG_0002>-modules<MATHSEG_0003>category of quasi-coherent<MATHSEG_0004>-modules<MATHSEG_0005>\nMoreover, an <MATH_0004>-module is\nquasi-coherent as an <MATH_0005>-module if and only if\nit is quasi-coherent as an <MATH_0006>-module.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{A} = f_*\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F} \\mapsto f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_X\\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{", "MATHSEG_0004": "}\\\\\n\\mathcal{A}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0005": "}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{A}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-equivalence-modules}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{category of quasi-coherent}\\\\\n\\mathcal{O}_X\\text{-modules}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\text{category of quasi-coherent}\\\\\n\\mathcal{A}\\text{-modules}\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:a02ad350de43f419d9da9dceb9c7c84298a2a0c037fee79626d727b2870fab24", "source_byte_span": {"start": 231, "end": 470}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHS