{"schema_version": 2, "unit_id": "tag:01SB:proof", "parent_tag": "01S5", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "The final statement is Lemma <REF_0001>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0002> and\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0003>\nthe pushforward <MATH_0001> of a quasi-coherent <MATH_0002>-module\n<MATH_0003>\nis a quasi-coherent <MATH_0004>-module. Hence a functor as in\nthe statement of the lemma.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nWe will construct an quasi-inverse <MATH_0005> to this functor. Let <MATH_0006>\nbe a quasi-coherent <MATH_0007>-module. Then we set\n<MATH_0008>\nElucidation: the pullback <MATH_0009>\nis an <MATH_0010>-algebra, the adjunction map\n<MATH_0011> is an algebra homomorphism, and\nthe pullback <MATH_0012> is an <MATH_0013>-module. Observe that\n<MATH_0014> is quasi-coherent as quasi-coherence is preserved by\npullbacks and change of rings. Observe that there is a functorial map\n<MATH_0015>\ncoming from the adjunction map <MATH_0016> and\na functorial map\n<MATHSEG_0001>adjoint to the map<MATHSEG_0002>\nwhich sends a local section <MATH_0017> of <MATH_0018> to <MATH_0019>.\nTo finish the proof it suffices to show that these maps are isomorphisms\nfor <MATH_0020> and <MATH_0021> as above. This may be checked on the\nmembers of an affine covering, i.e., when <MATH_0022> and <MATH_0023> are affine.\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\nThe key algebra observation which makes this work is the\nfollowing: Let <MATH_0024> be a ring map. Let <MATH_0025> be an <MATH_0026>-module. Then\n<MATH_0027>\nNamely, the left hand side of this equality is the effect of applying\n<MATH_0028> to the quasi-coherent <MATH_0029>-module <MATH_0030> on <MATH_0031>.\nWe omit the details.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-coherence-scalar-restriction}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-affine-separated}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-push-forward-quasi-coherent}", "MATH_0001": "$f_*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent", "MATH_0005": "$h$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\nh(\\mathcal{G}) = f^*\\mathcal{G} \\otimes_{f^*\\mathcal{A}} \\mathcal{O}_X =\nf^*\\mathcal{G} \\otimes_{f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} \\mathcal{O}_X\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$f^*\\mathcal{A} = f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0011": "$f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X \\to \\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0012": "$f^*\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0013": "$f^*\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0014": "$h(\\mathcal{G})$", "MATH_0015": "$$\nh(f_*\\mathcal{F}) =\nf^*f_*\\mathcal{F} \\otimes_{f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} \\mathcal{O}_X \\to \\mathcal{F}\n$$", "MATH_0016": "$f^*f_*\\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{F}$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\mathcal{G} \\to f_*h(\\mathcal{G}) \\quad\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\\quad\nf^*\\mathcal{G} \\to f^*\\mathcal{G} \\otimes_{f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} \\mathcal{O}_X\n$$", "MATH_0017": "$s$", "MATH_0018": "$f^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0019": "$s \\otimes 1$", "MATH_0020": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0021": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0022": "$X$", "MATH_0023": "$S$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0004": "\\noindent", "MATH_0024": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0025": "$N$", "MATH_0026": "$A$", "MATH_0027": "$$\n(N \\otimes_R A) \\otimes_{(A \\otimes_R A)} A = N\n$$", "MATH_0028": "$h$", "MATH_0029": "$\\widetilde{A}$", "MATH_0030": "$\\widetilde{N}$", "MATH_0031": "$\\Spec(R)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "math_text_regions": [{"region_id": "math/0001", "delimiter_kind": "display-dollar", "source": "$$\n\\mathcal{G} \\to f_*h(\\mathcal{G}) \\quad\\text{adjoint to the map}\\quad\nf^*\\mathcal{G} \\to f^*\\mathcal{G} \\otimes_{f^*f_*\\mathcal{O}_X} \\mathcal{O}_X\n$$", "source_hash": "sha256:83ccf930748dca466a693fbb62273df0398362f9b5e548caf0bce948ac2863ef", "source_byte_span": {"start": 1258, "end": 1411}, "pieces": [{"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0001"}, {"kind": "text", "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001"}, {"kind": "locked", "placeholder": "MATHSEG_0002"}], "slots": [{"slot_id": "math/0001/text/0001", "source": "adjoint to the map", "command": "text", "policy_entry": "p0-frame-morphisms-23", "slot_byte_span": {"start": 48, "end": 66}, "boundary_placeholders": ["MATHSEG_0001", "MATHSEG_0002"], "classification_witness": {"usage": "p0-locked-math-frame", "usage_source": {"before": "\\quad", "after": "\\quad", "environments": []}, "source_label": "morphisms-section-affine", "policy_hash": "sha256:31a4e4001a48a94be4c382192ee10f580ada1857e4f231caf35b1d31b2eb19ca", "anchor": {"source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "file": "morphisms.tex", "owner_tag": "01S5", "owner_label": "morphisms-section-affine", "kind": "section", "ordinal": 1, "matches": [{"container_byte_span": {"start": 69754, "end": 71831}, "container_hash": "sha256:69cfd020fb2c6aecd5ee865c950b593ad9fd75b1b24c4217b5897b7f80a15e49", "command_byte_span": {"start": 71054, "end": 71079}, "command_hash": "sha256:11b176ffde1c3410d0120fe60a44482ca86fb6ac52b1bf96c6fb69968b9df502"}]}}}]}], "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:6b92eb7ea1832a6718087d4b6b79cd92d31cae17f873a66b82133941974bbaa1", "source_text_hash": "sha256:20905f09215e0477e997311c0105f1ba07ec55761dff6ea888d4ddc4c10d8091", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5447ad5797b009089ab2c40c13bce9d5a50fba40eee4d8cb06405ba3c1c1bdfc", "source_math_hash": "sha256:813d1af78d6f7917f632e1b16695b1e440c94d9342444fc5e0d233841f4147da"}
